<resources>
    <!--
      Auto-odometer copy (docs/AUTO_ODOMETER_PLAN.md §8). English-only, house rule — every
      screen's text lives here even though F2's placeholder screens do not reference most of
      it yet, so F4-F8 only ever reference existing keys instead of adding hardcoded strings.
